    "Cost": 1555421,
    "UIName": "Templar",
    "Id": "chassisdef_templar_CRD-1R",
    "Name": "Templar",
    "Details": "The -1R is a large upgrade of the original TMP-1G. It replaces the engine with a 325 XL,  switches to double heat sinks and uses an Endo Steel chassis. As for its weapons, the 1R drops the PPC and machine guns of the -1G, replacing them with a second copy of both the SRM-6 and LRM-10 launchers. One more ton of LRM ammunition was also added.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_templar_crusadervariant"
  },
  "VariantName": "CRD-1R",
